/-!
# Distinctness of the point coordinates

A fixed integer linear functional takes pairwise distinct values on the 275
rows. Checking those values and their distinctness avoids comparing every pair
of 24-dimensional vectors. No general injectivity of the functional is asserted.
The data follow the same attributed marked coordinates as PointData.
-/
@[expose] public section
